! mcp_bootstrap_p289.strap -- MCP printed page 289: the SYN CARDS FOR
! THE CHANNEL/UNIT STATUS TABLE and the SYN CARDS FOR THE VALID CHECK
! TABLE (T VALVF VF,0.0 and the T TYBC .. T RCAD field SYNs), lines 1-31.
!
! docs/MCP_Mar63_250-445.pdf PDF p.40, read at 400 dpi.  Header, READ:
! "TIME CLOCK 00054041  PUNID 11D11MCP  CARD ID QE000138  DIST. OF 3/01
!  3/01  PAGE NUMBER 289" (round glyphs in numeric fields read 0).  The
! heading row's LOCATION field prints NOTHING: line 1 is a remark card
! and prints no word.
!
! THE PAGE.  31 lines, every line number prints a "*" after it, then
! blank paper.
!   lines  1-4   remark cards: rule, "SYN CARDS FOR THE CHANNEL/UNIT
!                STATUS TABLE", rule, "-".
!   lines  5-18  fourteen SYN cards (T CHSXW .. T OVRES).  A SYN row
!                prints its VALUE with a "+" in the LOCATION column,
!                "+00000000" and its dds (octal: BU,100,10 = (BU,64,8);
!                BU,22 = (BU,18); BU,01 / BU,04).  No !CHECK; their
!                values are the !SYMs below.
!   lines 19-24  remark cards: "-", "-", rule, "SYN CARDS FOR THE VALID
!                CHECK TABLE", rule, "-".
!   line  25     T VALVF VF,0.0 at 232512.00, prints 000000.00+ -- the
!                ONLY row on the page that compiles.
!   lines 26-31  six SYN cards (T TYBC, T MACBC, T REQBC print "NULL";
!                T TYAD, T MCAD, T RCAD print BU,10,10 = (BU,8,8)).
!
! THIS IS THE BODY'S RE-ASSEMBLY OF THE IPL ASSIGN PROGRAM's compool SYNs
! (landed p.62 lines 52-56 head the same block, "T CHSXW SYN,SXCHAN";
! pp.66/68/71/73/75 spell TUNTBA, TMULTI, TCHAVL, TUNAVL, TUNASG, TCHOWN,
! TEQUIP, TUNITK, TUNRES, TOVRES, TTYAD, TMCAD, TRCAD; p.65 TVALVF).
! Spellings follow those decks; the VALUES are this page's.  TFDISP,
! TSEL, TVER, TTYBC, TMACBC, TREQBC have no earlier spelling in decks/
! and are written as the ink prints them.
!
! JOIN.  The only located word is 232512.00 (a VF, one half word), so
! the location counter leaves the page at 232512.40.  p.288 (no scratch
! neighbour deck when this was written) should end just below 232512.00;
! p.290 should open at 232512.40.  Contiguity NOT established here.
!
! GLYPHS SETTLED BY OTHER THAN PLAIN INK:
!   * line 18 label prints "T CVRES" (open O) = TOVRES: the remark on
!     the same row prints "OVERLAP" with the same glyph, and pp.71/75
!     spell TOVRES.
!   * line 12 "T CHOWN": O as pp.71/73/75 TCHOWN.
!   * line 29 prints "SYN (BU,8),C.0" -- a BLANK between SYN and "(".
!     The row prints dds BU,10,10, so the assembler took (BU,8) as the
!     SYN's data description; written SYN(BU,8),0.0 as p.66 line
!     "TTYAD SYN(BU,8),0.0".  "C.0" is 0.0 (numeric field; prints
!     000000.00+).
!   * octal fields "CCCCCC.CC", "+CCCCCCCC" and statements "C.0",
!     "TTYAD+C.8", "TMCAD+C.8" are 0 (numeric context; the values
!     000000.10+ / 000000.20+ agree).
!   * line 5 "SXCFAN" (H with a worn bar) = SXCHAN, printed p.103's XW;
!     the row prints 215002.00 = SXCHAN's value there.
!
! EXTERNALS.  SXCHAN is printed p.103 line 28 "SXCHAN XW,0" at 215002.00
! (landed); stand-in carries the XW label's dds (BU), as decks/ write
! other XW stand-ins.  This page's line 5 prints 215002.00+ BU,100,10:
! BIT-EXACT.
!
! CARD SERIALS.  QE000138 .. QE000168, line N prints QE0001(37+N); none
! shared or skipped.

SXCHAN  SYN(BU), (8)215002.0         ! landed p.103 line 28 "SXCHAN XW,0"; line 5 prints 215002.00+ BU,100,10, BIT-EXACT

! line  1  - ---------------------------------------------------------
! line  2  -        SYN CARDS FOR THE CHANNEL/UNIT STATUS TABLE
! line  3  - ---------------------------------------------------------
! line  4  -
TCHSXW  SYN,SXCHAN                                           ! line  5  -INDEX WORD FOR CHAN STAT TBL  (printed "SXCFAN")
TUNTBA  SYN(BU,18),0.0                                       ! line  6  -THE UNIT TABLE ADDRESS
TMULTI  SYN(BU,1),0.27                                       ! line  7  -THE MULTI -CHANNEL BIT
TCHAVL  SYN(BU,1),0.25                                       ! line  8  -THE CHANNEL AVAILABLE BIT
TFDISP  SYN(BU,1),0.27                                       ! line  9  -THE KIND OF REEL MOUNTED ON UNIT
TUNAVL  SYN(BU,1),0.28                                       ! line 10  -THE UNIT AVAILABLE BIT
TUNASG  SYN(BU,1),0.29                                       ! line 11  -THE UNIT ASSIGNED BIT
TCHOWN  SYN(BU,1),0.32                                       ! line 12  -THE OWNERSHIP LEVEL INDICATOR
TSEL    SYN(BU,1),0.39                                       ! line 13  -THE MULTI UNIT SELECT BIT
TVER    SYN(BU,1),0.40                                       ! line 14  -THE VERIFY BIT
TEQUIP  SYN(BU,4),0.52                                       ! line 15  -TYPE OF UNIT REQUESTED
TUNITK  SYN(BU,4),0.59                                       ! line 16  -NUMBER OF UNITS TO A GIVEN CHANNEL
TUNRES  SYN(BU,1),0.62                                       ! line 17  -NOT OVERLAP RESERVED BIT
TOVRES  SYN(BU,1),0.63                                       ! line 18  -THE OVERLAP RESERVED BIT  (label printed "T CVRES")
! line 19  -
! line 20  -
! line 21  - ---------------------------------------------------------
! line 22  -        SYN CARDS FOR THE VALID CHECK TABLE
! line 23  - ---------------------------------------------------------
! line 24  -

        SLC, (8)232512.00
TVALVF  VF,0.0                                               ! line 25  -TO PREVENT A DOUBLE VALIDITY CHECK
TTYBC   SYN,0.8                                              ! line 26  -THE TYPE CODE BIT COUNT
TMACBC  SYN,0.8                                              ! line 27  -THE MACHINE CONF COUNT BIT COUNT
TREQBC  SYN,0.8                                              ! line 28  -THE REQUEST COUNT BIT COUNT
TTYAD   SYN(BU,8),0.0                                        ! line 29  -ADDRESS OF THE TYPE CODE  (printed "SYN (BU,8),C.0", a blank before "(")
TMCAD   SYN(BU,8),TTYAD+0.8                                  ! line 30  -MACHINE CONF COUNT ADDRESS
TRCAD   SYN(BU,8),TMCAD+0.8                                  ! line 31  -THE REQUEST COUNT ADDRESS

!SYM TCHSXW 215002.00
!SYM TUNTBA 000000.00
!SYM TMULTI 000000.33
!SYM TCHAVL 000000.31
!SYM TFDISP 000000.33
!SYM TUNAVL 000000.34
!SYM TUNASG 000000.35
!SYM TCHOWN 000000.40
!SYM TSEL   000000.47
!SYM TVER   000000.50
!SYM TEQUIP 000000.64
!SYM TUNITK 000000.73
!SYM TUNRES 000000.76
!SYM TOVRES 000000.77
!SYM TVALVF 232512.00
!SYM TTYBC  000000.10
!SYM TMACBC 000000.10
!SYM TREQBC 000000.10
!SYM TTYAD  000000.00
!SYM TMCAD  000000.10
!SYM TRCAD  000000.20
!CHECK 232512.00 | 000000.00+ | line 25 TVALVF VF,0.0
